Not part of the standard contract build/test loop.

gnaw's fixture tasks skip packages carrying this marker. This package is
built only by scripts/bigint-bench.sh, once per (backend, operation) pair, and
only for rv32:

    scripts/bigint-bench.sh                  # full rv32 codesize + gas sweep
    cargo gnaw test bigint-bench-contract    # host differential test only

The package name deliberately lacks the `-rv32` suffix so the standard rv32
wrapper glob (and scripts/metrics/sdk_codesizes_rv32.sh, which derives its
append-only metric rows from that same glob) does not pick up 34 build variants
of it.
